        <span class="line" data-enter data-enter-step="2">that help Dhaka’s best</span>
        <span class="line" data-enter data-enter-step="3">businesses <em class="accent text-lime">grow.</em></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg text-cream/75 sm:text-xl" data-enter data-enter-step="4">Design, build and marketing from one senior team. Fixed quotes, clear timelines, and results you can measure.</p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3" data-enter data-enter-step="5">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-lime text-base" data-open-enquiry>Start a project <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a href="/estimate" class="btn btn-outline text-base" data-open-estimate>Estimate my project</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-cream/60" data-enter data-enter-step="5">
        <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-lime" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        We reply within one business day
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative lg:col-span-5" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero-stack relative mx-auto aspect-[5/4] w-full max-w-[620px]">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-[4%] w-[88%] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-cream/10 bg-ink-2 shadow-2xl shadow-black/50" data-enter data-enter-step="2" data-drift="-30">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-cream/10 px-4 py-3"><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-cream/20"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-cream/20"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-cream/20"></span><span class="ml-3 h-5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-cream/5 text-[10px] leading-5 text-cream/40 pl-3">meridianresidences.com.bd</span></div>
          <div class="relative aspect-[16/10]">
            <%- img('p-realestate-1', { cls: 'absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover', eager: true, sizes: '(min-width: 1024px) 520px, 90vw', alt: '' }) %>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-ink/80 via-ink/30 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute left-5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 sm:left-7">
              <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold leading-tight text-cream sm:text-2xl">Live above<br>the city.</p>
              <span class="mt-3 inline-block rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-ink sm:text-xs">Book a site visit</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-[2%] right-0 w-[36%] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.6rem] border-[5px] border-ink-3 bg-ink-2 shadow-2xl shadow-black/60" data-enter data-enter-step="3" data-drift="-70">
          <div class="relative aspect-[9/19]">
            <%- img('p-fashion-1', { cls: 'absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover', sizes: '220px', alt: '' }) %>
            <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/90 to-transparent p-3">
